{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"instruction","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n255.jpg","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"בעלינו פותחים הארון, בשלא שם חלקנו סוגרים הארון, בואנחנו כורעים פותחים הארון."}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n            "}
{"start":"j:transclude","attrs":{"type":"external","target":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/aleinu@prayerbook_for_the_new_year-heidenheim-1965-he"}}
