{"tail":"\n            "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"instruction","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n255.jpg","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"de-Hebr"}}
{"text":"וואֶהרענד ד״א געמיינדע "}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"הוּא אֳלֹהֵֽינוּ"}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" א״ז״וו זאַגט, ספריכֿט דער חזן פֿאַלגענדע: לייזע:"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n            "}
{"start":"j:transclude","attrs":{"type":"external","target":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/attah_horeta_quiet@prayerbook_for_the_new_year-heidenheim-1965-he"}}
{"end":"j:transclude"}
{"tail":"\n            "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"instruction","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n255.jpg","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"סוגרים הארון."}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n            "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"instruction","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n255.jpg","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"הש״ץ חוזר בקול רם הוא אלהינו וכו׳."}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n            "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"instruction","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n255.jpg","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"הש״ץ אומר בנגון."}
{"end":"t:note"}
